                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Not sure what I just experienced.  It's a seated, cinematic VR experience.  There's a narrator.  There's some okay visuals.  The narrator is talking nonsense.  There's no story.  Something something about language and technology.  More mumbo jumbo.  Visuals mixed in.  They jumped to a conclusion, filled their theory with different words.  But somehow they want you to believe 1 + 1 = 3.  This game should be called Soup VR.  Mix of words and visuals, all thrown in together.  Or Word Vomit VR.\n\nRating 3/10",
